<title>UK: FORECAST-European bourse predictions for 96 and 97.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-European bourse predictions for 96 and 97.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are forecasts collected by Reuters this week for where major European stock indices will close at the end of 1996 and 1997.</p>
<p>Scroll down to see predictions in alphabetical order by country for the Paris CAC-40, Frankfurt DAX, Milan BCI General, Amsterdam AEX, Oslo Total Index, Stockholm General, Zurich SMI and SPI and London FTSE-100 indices.</p>
<p>The individual forecasts for each index, attributed where available, are prefaced by an average for each year and a percentage difference for these figures against the close on October 9. Recent records achieved by each bourse are also shown.</p>
<p>The forecasts were collated from institutions in London and, where marked, in the home financial centre of the relevant stock exchange.</p>
